From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] riched20: ITextDocument Open, Save, New, name and saved state; object text (2020)

riched20: ITextDocument Open, Save, New, name and saved state; object text (2020)

From Wine's todo_wine blocks, which record Windows: ITextDocument::Open
opens a file with the disposition, sharing, code page and RTF/text flags
(holding it open only when sharing is denied), Save writes the text or
RTF to a file or the current one, New starts empty, GetName / GetSaved /
SetSaved; an embedded object is U+FFFC in text taken as it is (not with
GT_USECRLF) and ranges and selections of a plain text control have no
final CR.
